{"chapter": "morphisms", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "01WG", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : X \\to S$", "MATH_0002": "$f$", "MATH_0003": "$S = \\bigcup U_i$", "MATH_0004": "$f^{-1}(U_i)$", "MATH_0005": "$\\mathcal{O}_S(U_i) \\to \\mathcal{O}_X(f^{-1}(U_i))$", "MATH_0006": "$S = \\bigcup U_i$", "MATH_0007": "$f^{-1}(U_i) \\to U_i$", "MATH_0008": "$f$", "MATH_0009": "$U \\subset S$", "MATH_0010": "$f : f^{-1}(U) \\to U$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-finite-local}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:b911e3f370ea2c149c95f7d1bc4212387797dab52c7ee6725f527d8db452349d", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:8702146cf9d95829454a4afebf23e14caf49acb104797eca5c4bff6578c12a14", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of schemes.\nThe following are equivalent:\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> The morphism <MATH_0002> is finite.\n<STRUCT_0003> There exists an affine open covering <MATH_0003> such that\neach <MATH_0004> is affine and\n<MATH_0005> is finite.\n<STRUCT_0004> There exists an open covering <MATH_0006>\nsuch that each <MATH_0007> is finite.\n<STRUCT_0005>\nMoreover, if <MATH_0008> is finite then for every open subscheme\n<MATH_0009> the morphism <MATH_0010> is finite.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:5990a12027f19281d1c384369bf3eb0072de601c96def8df6c8e4100209e551f", "unit_id": "tag:01WI:statement"}
