MATH_0036> where the map <MATH_0037> sends <MATH_0038> to an\ninvertible element and <MATH_0039> sends <MATH_0040> to <MATH_0041>. Since <MATH_0042>\nis surjective this implies <MATH_0043> is empty, as\nwe wanted to show.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c2c986dfa7f7f3706b7f169f633cc76156b23c0699548af4b588cc37e96aa461", "unit_id": "tag:01WM:proof"}
